      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Hi sorry for the late response to this so it wasn't the dead zone. On the weekend you literally couldn't put some sliders to certain values was happening to me and a lot of my friends, it might have been caused by some kind of server issues maybe? I'm not 100% sure but on Monday it was fixed which was very odd. But on the subject of the other question you asked if the snapping zone should be changed, Honestly I think that just having the entire slider be smooth and not snap to a specific value would be better, mainly because if we wanna go back to the default height we can just hit the reset height button.",
